@sheet Data
@header | Label | Amount | Live | Start | Note |
| Alpha | 10 | TRUE | 2026-01-01 | "TRUE" |
| Beta | 20 | FALSE | 2026-01-02 | "123" |
| Gamma | 30 | TRUE | 2026-01-03 | plain |

@sheet Summary
@header | Metric | Value |
| Total amount | =SUM(!!Amount) |
| Gate | =IF(B2>50,"HIGH","OK") |
| First start | =Data!D2 |

@sheet Review
@header | Metric | Value |
| Carry | =Summary!B2 |
| Date copy | =Summary!B4 |
